  "prefLabel": "Fis 1508.03 Duplicate Certificates",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 1508.03 Duplicate Certificates. Students who have successfully completed an OHRV or snowmobile safety course may obtain a duplicate certificate of completion without charge by contacting the law enforcement division of the department.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Fis 1500) #12590, eff 7-25-18",
